1
00:00:49,039 --> 00:00:50,520
Regarding the serial murders back then,

2
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,719
I've been refining the criminal profiling.

3
00:00:53,119 --> 00:00:54,200
According to the past investigation,

4
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,159
the suspect was actually a middle-aged man.

5
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:57,799
By now, he'd only be older.

6
00:00:58,799 --> 00:01:00,200
Yet the person Zhang Dafeng described

7
00:01:00,719 --> 00:01:01,039
was tall,

8
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:01,799
lean,

9
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:02,600
pale,

10
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,239
and terrified him.

11
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,719
That means this person

12
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:08,040
could physically overpower him.

13
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:09,359
So,

14
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,599
it's someone young and experienced.

15
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:13,359
You suspect Shen Yu?

16
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:14,959
No.

17
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:16,920
It's another brother of his,

18
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,040
either older or younger.

19
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,760
Unlike Shen Xian, the acknowledged son,

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,560
he was branded an illegitimate son.

21
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,879
He secretly contacted Zhang Dafeng,

22
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:26,120
Li Changyu,

23
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,159
and He Shuyi

24
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,359
anonymously online

25
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,040
under the alias Cruz.

26
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,439
If it's truly the Shen family's

27
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:34,640
unknown illegitimate son,

28
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,599
he should be younger than Shen Xian.

29
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:38,400
He wouldn't have been old enough back then.

30
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,519
Could it be...

31
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,200
there's an accomplice?

32
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,280
The serial killer from years ago

33
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,519
and the instigator behind these murders...

34
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,560
They seem more like an organization.

35
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,439
In their worldview,

36
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,760
they're doing what they believe is right.

37
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,680
They exploit the darkness in human nature

38
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,159
to eliminate their obstacles.

39
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,599
And the mastermind behind them

40
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,400
must be highly intelligent

41
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,120
with formidable leadership skills.

42
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:04,439
Furthermore,

43
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,400
they must possess exceptional verbal

44
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,640
and written communication skills.

45
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:10,639
We'll follow the trail

46
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,080
of the Shen family's illegitimate son.

47
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,560
Gu Yan.

48
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,400
If that illegitimate son doesn't exist,

49
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,639
Shen Yu is the prime suspect.

50
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:24,960
What will you do?

51
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,479
I don't regret a single moment

52
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:29,319
I've spent with him.

53
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,319
If he truly is a monster,

54
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,080
I'll drag him to hell myself.

55
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:43,960
Professor Chen.

56
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,520
Gu Yan.

57
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,360
What brings you to campus?

58
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:51,159
After our talk last time,

59
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,400
between the case and work,

60
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,400
I've been under a lot of pressure.

61
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:54,319
So,

62
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,280
I wanted to visit my alma mater

63
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:56,919
to unwind for a bit.

64
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,560
We spend so much time

65
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,800
analyzing other people's psychology.

66
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,879
Now,

67
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,639
I'd like to ask your advice on handling stress.

68
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:03,919
There are plenty of ways.

69
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,960
I'm heading to my apartment for a nap.

70
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,479
Do you have time?

71
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:09,439
Of course.

72
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,360
Good.

73
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,759
Let's talk at my place,

74
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,759
and then

75
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:13,759
have a casual meal together.

76
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,240
Sounds wonderful.

77
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:15,520
Let's go.

78
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:22,520
Come in.

79
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,960
This is my place.

80
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,960
It's my first time at your apartment.

81
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:26,919
Well,

82
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,360
I rarely

83
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,680
have visitors over.

84
00:03:30,599 --> 00:03:31,080
Oh, right.

85
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,439
How is your leg?

86
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,439
I still can't walk properly.

87
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,000
A couple of days ago, because of my leg,

88
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,520
I was almost attacked.

89
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,639
You really need to be careful.

90
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,120
Have a seat.

91
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,879
I'll get you some water.

92
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:42,360
Thanks.

93
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,639
Here's some water.

94
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,400
Thank you, Professor.

95
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,000
Make yourself at home.

96
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:58,680
I'll start cooking.

97
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,199
It won't take long.

98
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:00,319
Thanks, Professor.

99
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,280
Old Chen!

100
00:04:12,159 --> 00:04:13,039
I made bone broth.

101
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:13,840
Come have a taste.

102
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,079
Oh, you have a guest today!

103
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,639
You're Yang Lifang from sociology, right?

104
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:23,759
I'm Gu Yan, one of Professor Chen's students.

105
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:26,120
Professor Chen has indeed taught

106
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,240
quite a few outstanding students.

107
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,079
Here.

108
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:30,160
You're in luck, I made bone broth today.

109
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:30,879
Come have some.

110
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:31,279
Oh, wow.

111
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,120
That's wonderful.

112
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,040
Don't mind if I do, then.

113
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,439
Great.

114
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:34,800
Well, Professor Yang,

115
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,879
you two chat for a bit.

116
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:36,600
Dinner will be ready soon.

117
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:36,879
Okay.

118
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:45,879
I really had no idea

119
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:46,800
that Professor Chen

120
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,240
has lived alone in the faculty housing

121
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,120
for so many years.

122
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,319
Let's eat.

123
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:02,879
Here you go, Gu Yan.

124
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:05,160
Wow, this piece is huge.

125
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,519
Old Chen, have some too.

126
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,720
I can get it myself.

127
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:10,439
You...

128
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,240
You two eat too.

129
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,279
Have some food, Gu Yan.

130
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,319
Professor Chen,

131
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,240
you're always on your own,

132
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,839
with no one around to look after you.

133
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,920
Now,

134
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,040
seeing that you're here,

135
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,399
I'm much more relieved.

136
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,319
Well...

137
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:23,879
Eat up.

138
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,040
Make yourself at home.

139
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:28,399
Gu Yan,

140
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,319
come visit more often.

141
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:29,879
I will.

142
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,439
Are you full?

143
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,399
Oh, Old Chen...

144
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,639
This place is such a mess.

145
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:37,279
Professor,

146
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,040
in this photo...

147
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,439
is that you and a young Shen Yu?

148
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,120
Oh,

149
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,439
that photo.

150
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,959
His father and I are old friends.

151
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,000
Otherwise, I wouldn't have easily

152
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:50,959
recommended him to go there

153
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,040
to be your assistant.

154
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,240
I see.

155
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,360
Oh, right.

156
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:55,600
How is he doing these days?

157
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,319
He helps me with a lot of things.

158
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,199
I like him a lot.

159
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,399
By the way, Professor Chen,

160
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,399
Zhang Dafeng said

161
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,879
he saw the face of the killer

162
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:05,879
who murdered my mother.

163
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:08,000
I believe the suspect's sketch

164
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,879
should be ready in a couple of days.

165
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:12,800
That's wonderful!

166
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,360
Gu Yan,

167
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,160
I hope you can bring the culprit

168
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,800
to justice soon.

169
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:20,240
I hope so too.

170
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,000
Gu Yan,

171
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,920
take care on your way back!

172
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:24,519
Will do.

173
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:26,079
Old Chen, let me do the dishes for you.

174
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,279
There's cream on your lips.

175
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,000
With so much stress,

176
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,519
sweets aren't enough to take the edge off.

177
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:14,560
I want to try a kiss.

178
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,079
Then I'll let you try.

179
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,160
Gu Yan,

180
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:33,920
all these years,

181
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,439
you've never been alone.

182
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,240
What if I feel

183
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:28,720
it's still not enough?
